      "key": "assessment",
      "name": "Assessment",
      "icon": null,
      "description": "One row per assessment/audit cycle (a self-assessment, a 3PAO assessment, an internal audit, ...) -- a cover record for the engagement itself: who ran it, over what scope, when, and the overall result. Per-control results don't live here -- record those directly on the relevant rows of the Security Control asset type (security-control-register.rain, same directory) via its own Last Assessment Date/Last Assessment Result/Assessor fields, the same way you'd re-import that register's CSV with those columns updated. Each Asset's own \"Name\" field names the engagement, e.g. \"2026 Q3 CMMC Level 2 self-assessment\".",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 0
    }
  ],
